    Practical 5
Step 8: Protect Only One Action
If only one action needs protection, use [Authorize] on that action:
public class StudentController : Controller
{
    public ActionResult About()
    {
        return View();
    }

    [Authorize]
    public ActionResult Result()
    {
        return View();
    }
}

Now:
/Student/About

→ Accessible without login.
/Student/Result

→ Login required.     Practical 5
